 "notes": [
  "The byline 'Artemis \".\" Entreri' is a fictional name (the Forgotten Realms assassin) with a blank handle, so the deck is credited as plain text to 'Artemis Entreri' with no player page, matching deck 16887 by the same poster.",
  "Starting cards are marked in the list rather than in a separate section: '(SL)' on Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon and Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon (the Objective's starting sites), '(SI)' on Prepared Defenses, and '(SE)' on All Wrapped Up, Mobilization Points and Power Of The Hutt (the starting Effects). All count toward the 60. None of the three Effects is named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "'(SE)' read as 'starting Effect', not Special Edition, so All Wrapped Up, Mobilization Points and Power Of The Hutt are the printed cards, not the (V) pages.",
  "Posted 'CC Fett' dested Boba Fett (Cloud City); 'Dr E/Ponda Boba' dested the Reflections II combo Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba; 'Beolo' dested Boelo; 'Iggy w/gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; '4-Lom w/gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand.",
  "Posted 'Tat Mosi Eisely', 'Tat Docking Bay', 'Endor Docking Bay', 'JP Audeince Chanber' and 'Vibro Axe' dested the Dark pages; 'Weapon Levitation' dested the Dark Cloud City interrupt; 'Secret Plans' is an Effect in 2001.",
  "Total 60 as posted."
 ],
